ly,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_13","text":"I'm the winner!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_14","text":"I'm happy for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_15","text":"Thanks, heehee!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_16","text":"Wait a minute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_17","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_17","text":"After a while, there's another message from N102.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_18","text":"Anis said messaging you is cheating,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_19","text":"so this round doesn't count.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_20","text":"She says we have to play again, but","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_21","text":"you're the only contact in my phone.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_22","text":"I'm totally gonna lose! T^T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_23","text":"Why is texting me considered cheating?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_24","text":"Because you always respond right away ;(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_25","text":"Tell Anis something for me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_26","text":"Sure?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_27","text":"Tell her she didn't think of messaging me, so that's her loss.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_28","text":"That's a great idea!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_29","text":"I'll tell her right away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_30","text":"Hmmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_31","text":"She's not to happy right now, hehehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_32","text":"She says she'll concede this round.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_33","text":"Teacher, you're the best!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_34","text":"Next time, I will buy you a croquette.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_35","text":"Thanks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_36","text":"Anis wants me to play a different game with her.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"n102","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_37","text":"Gotta go!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_n102_02_38","text":"Have fun.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_n102_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":